Chladni Plate

@Cartocopia

for the #WCCChallenge - Nodes 🌿 

A completely oversimplified simulation of grains vibrating to form figures on a Chladni Plate
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ernst_Chladni#Chladni_figures

The particles settle along the zero crossing nodes of a vibrating plate

